  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities Alliance 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cities Alliance 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities Alliance is a global collaboration between most of the         relevant stakeholders within urban development such as UN-Habitat,    World Bank, UCLG and SDI. The main activities are country and         regional programmes, catalytic (small project) fund, knowledge and    learning, and communication and advocacy. Its focus is on, among      other, poor people, Sub-sahara Africa and secondary cities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insats WB TF-fond - Kan d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r st&#xe4;ngas f&#xf6;rst 170701. Cities Alliance  &#xe4;r en global sammanslutning av de flesta relevanta akt&#xf6;rerna inom     urban utveckling s&#xe5;som tex UN-Habitat, V&#xe4;rldsbanken, UCLG och SDI.    Huvudaktiviteterna best&#xe5;r av land och regionala program, katalytiska  fonden, kunskapsutveckling samt kommunikation och lobbying. Fokus     fattiga m&#xe4;nniskor, Afrika s&#xf6;der Sahara, sekond&#xe4;ra st&#xe4;der.</narrative>
  </description>
